OL,6, An explosion has damaged the offices
OL,7, of the African National Congress in
OL,8, Islington, north London.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FPolice said the explosion, which was
OL,11,Fheard two miles away, was the result of
OL,12,Fa bomb of about 10lbs. They are looking
OL,13,Ffor a man seen in the area soon after.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FThe only person in the building at the
OL,16,Ftime of the blast, a voluntary worker,
OL,17,Fwas unhurt. He got out over adjoining
OL,18,Frooftops because the staircase was
OL,19,Fblown away.
OL,20,F
OL,21,FThe ANC is a South African black
OL,22,Fnationalist movement which is banned
OL,23,Fby the Pretoria governmentD]G14-03-82
